  "Feeds W8-18u (dialogs::recovery::path_panel). Reflection over RecoveryDialog; internal records of PhotoReview.App.Shared built with Activator; no window.",
  "details_text -> text (BuildDetailsText) and action_label (Tr.RecoveryDetailAction, English). text_color -> color (TextColorOf). explorer_args -> args (what the Explorer seam received; $ROOT and $NODRIVE tokens). copy -> calls.",
  "The Win32Exception branch of ShowInExplorer is not here (needs the message-box seam): hand-written Rust test."
